mlxflow 0.8; network
1. Web Search   "local LLM quantization"; top_k=8; recency=week
2. <each fetch_one; on_error=skip ; [url] -> [text]>
     1. Web Fetch   (input:1)   as=markdown
     2. Summarize               Ministral 3B; "2 lines: what's new here"
3. Join Text    separator="\n\n"
4. Rewrite      Qwen3 8B; "Merge overlapping items; rank by novelty"
5. Save Text    topic-weekly.md
